Here on Route 6, there's a place called
Mistralton Cave.{VAR BE01}
Supposedly, deep in that cave you can
find an amazing Pokémon called Cobalion,{VAR BE00}
who was said to have protected Pokémon{VAR BE00}
from a sea of fire in ancient Unova.{VAR BE01}
If you can use a move called Surf
that lets you move over the water's{VAR BE00}
surface, maybe you can see Cobalion.

Now what should I do?{VAR BE01}
The entrance to Chargestone Cave,
just ahead, is blocked off.{VAR BE01}
It's because of a Pokémon called
Galvantula, and if I don't ask Clay{VAR BE00}
to do something, there's no way to pass.

Chargestone Cave seems like
a complicated maze, but actually{VAR BE00}
it's a straight road.

entries.text:
Trainer Tips!{VAR BE01}

You can register certain items with
the Y Button to use them easily!{VAR BE01}
Look for a square checkbox beside
the name of a Key Item.
